@startuml
title Morpho Vault V1 - enabling and removing a market
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam ActivityBackgroundColor #EEF5FF
skinparam ActivityBorderColor #4A78B5
start
:Curator: submitCap(market, higher cap);
:Wait for the timelock (guardian may revoke);
:Anyone: acceptCap(market)\nmarket appended to withdraw queue;
:Allocator: add market to supply queue;
:Market receives deposits and reallocations;
:Curator: lower cap to 0 (immediate);
if (Supply can be withdrawn?) then (yes)
  :Allocator: reallocate supply out;
  :Allocator: updateWithdrawQueue without the market;
else (no: reverts or illiquid)
  :Curator: submitMarketRemoval;
  :Wait for the timelock;
  :Allocator: updateWithdrawQueue without the market\nremaining supply written off;<<#FDEEEE>>
endif
stop
@enduml
